     "Optimal fractionation in radiotherapy for non-small cell lung cancer – a modelling approach, Acta Oncologica 2015;54:1592-1598 – Lindblom, Dasu, Toma-Dasu (https://medicaljournalssweden.se/actaoncologica/article/download/26596/31300/79123)",
